---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Blog — Image to STL Guides, Tips &amp; Tutorials"
  description="Free guides, tips, and tutorials for converting images to STL files. Learn about 3D printing, heightmaps, lithophanes, and more from the Image to STL team."
  canonical="https://www.image-2-stl.com/blog/"
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12">
    <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tighter text-surface-900 dark:text-surface-100 mb-2">Image to STL Blog</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-surface-500 mb-10">Guides, tutorials, and tips for 3D printing and image-to-STL conversion.</p>

    <div class="space-y-8">
      <a href="/blog/3d-printing-basics/" class="block p-6 rounded-tool border border-surface-200 dark:border-surface-800 hover:border-accent-300 dark:hover:border-accent-700 transition-colors group">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-surface-900 dark:text-surface-100 group-hover:text-accent-600 transition-colors mb-2">3D Printing Basics — The Complete Beginner&apos;s Guide</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-surface-500 leading-relaxed mb-3">Everything you need to know to go from unboxing your first 3D printer to holding your first successful print. Covers FDM vs resin, essential terminology, slicer setup, filament types, and getting started.</p>
        <span class="text-xs text-accent-600 dark:text-accent-400 font-medium">Read guide &rarr;</span>
      </a>

      <a href="/blog/what-is-stl-file/" class="block p-6 rounded-tool border border-surface-200 dark:border-surface-800 hover:border-accent-300 dark:hover:border-accent-700 transition-colors group">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-surface-900 dark:text-surface-100 group-hover:text-accent-600 transition-colors mb-2">What Is an STL File? Complete Format Guide</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-surface-500 leading-relaxed mb-3">Everything about the STL file format: what STL stands for, how triangle meshes work, binary vs ASCII, how to create STL files, and common issues with solutions.</p>
        <span class="text-xs text-accent-600 dark:text-accent-400 font-medium">Read guide &rarr;</span>
      </a>

      <a href="/blog/best-image-to-stl-converters/" class="block p-6 rounded-tool border border-surface-200 dark:border-surface-800 hover:border-accent-300 dark:hover:border-accent-700 transition-colors group">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-surface-900 dark:text-surface-100 group-hover:text-accent-600 transition-colors mb-2">Best Image to STL Converters Compared</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-surface-500 leading-relaxed mb-3">We tested the most popular free image to STL converters: browser-based, server-based, and desktop options. Side-by-side comparison with feature table.</p>
        <span class="text-xs text-accent-600 dark:text-accent-400 font-medium">Read guide &rarr;</span>
      </a>

      <a href="/how-to-convert-image-to-stl/" class="block p-6 rounded-tool border border-surface-200 dark:border-surface-800 hover:border-accent-300 dark:hover:border-accent-700 transition-colors group">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-surface-900 dark:text-surface-100 group-hover:text-accent-600 transition-colors mb-2">How to Convert an Image to STL — Step-by-Step Guide</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-surface-500 leading-relaxed mb-3">Complete tutorial covering three methods to convert images to STL: online tools, Blender, and Cura. Method comparison, troubleshooting, and best practices.</p>
        <span class="text-xs text-accent-600 dark:text-accent-400 font-medium">Read guide &rarr;</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 p-6 rounded-tool border border-accent-200 dark:border-accent-800 bg-accent-50 dark:bg-accent-900/10 text-center">
      <p class="text-sm text-surface-700 dark:text-surface-300 mb-3">Ready to create your first 3D model? Try our converter now.</p>
      <a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg bg-accent-600 hover:bg-accent-700 text-white text-sm font-medium transition-colors">Convert Image to STL</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
